together with their SIL Open Font License 1.1.
The LaTeX templates ship Inter, Poppins and JetBrains Mono in Fonts/, one folder per family with its OFL.txt.

Data
----
Postal codes and towns for Germany, Austria and Switzerland: GeoNames (https://www.geonames.org/),
licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
Changes: company/authority postcodes and Swiss PO box variants removed; Vienna districts merged into "Wien".

